  << /ActualText (I standardize and improve the adoption of the web design system in Figma and React\054 initiate cross\055functional collaboration\054 and develop AI\055powered interface generation\072\nAccelerated routine design tasks in Figma up to 4x by introducing coding agents into the team workflow\072 minor component changes\054 bulk variable operations and publish to gitlab\nDeveloped an automatic environment setup script that reduced onboarding time for interface generation from 1\0565\240hours to 5\240minutes and lowered the barrier for non\055developers\nAuthored a series of guides on AI\055powered interface generation with the design system\050\050the materials reached 2\054500\053 views among 140\053 specialists\051\nLed a workshop for designers on prototyping in Figma Make and prepared a template based on design system styles for 50\053 designers\nDesigned a unified semantic color palette for multiple products to improve design consistency across different domains\nAnalyzed 70\053 design system components and eliminated visual inconsistencies between Figma and React libraries \05068\045 \222 0\045\051)
